---
// HistoricalArmsRaceTimeline.astro
---
<div class="my-14 border border-navy-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">The Tax Arms Race</h3>
    <p class="text-navy-500 dark:text-navy-400 text-sm mt-2">How one loophole's closure creates the next.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Timeline Vertical Line -->
    <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-navy-200 dark:bg-navy-800 sm:-translate-x-1/2"></div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:justify-between w-full group">
        <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold-500 border-4 border-white dark:border-navy-950 shadow sm:-translate-x-1/2 z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        
        <div class="ml-12 sm:ml-0 sm:w-5/12 text-left sm:text-right pr-0 sm:pr-8">
          <div class="text-gold-600 dark:text-gold-500 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Pre-2001</div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Dividend Stripping</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 leading-relaxed">
            Investors bought mutual funds just before dividend declaration, received tax-free dividends, and sold the units at a loss to offset other gains.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block sm:w-5/12"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:justify-between w-full group">
        <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-4 border-white dark:border-navy-950 shadow sm:-translate-x-1/2 z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        
        <div class="hidden sm:block sm:w-5/12"></div>
        <div class="ml-12 sm:ml-0 sm:w-5/12 text-left pl-0 sm:pl-8">
          <div class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-500 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">2001 Budget</div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Section 94(7) Enacted</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 leading-relaxed">
            Government bans dividend stripping by ignoring losses if units are bought within 3 months before, and sold within 9 months after, the record date.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:justify-between w-full group">
        <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gold-500 border-4 border-white dark:border-navy-950 shadow sm:-translate-x-1/2 z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        
        <div class="ml-12 sm:ml-0 sm:w-5/12 text-left sm:text-right pr-0 sm:pr-8">
          <div class="text-gold-600 dark:text-gold-500 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">2004–2022</div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Bonus Stripping Emerges</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 leading-relaxed">
            Denied dividends, taxpayers shifted to bonus stripping. The logic was identical, but Section 94(7) strictly applied only to dividends, leaving bonus issues untouched.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block sm:w-5/12"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:justify-between w-full group">
        <div class="absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-4 border-white dark:border-navy-950 shadow sm:-translate-x-1/2 z-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-125"></div>
        
        <div class="hidden sm:block sm:w-5/12"></div>
        <div class="ml-12 sm:ml-0 sm:w-5/12 text-left pl-0 sm:pl-8">
          <div class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-500 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">2022 Budget</div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Section 94(8) Enacted</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 leading-relaxed">
            The loophole is finally closed. Losses from bonus stripping are now completely ignored and instead added to the cost basis of the retained bonus units.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
